---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout
  title="CTW Studio – Interaction Design Engineering"
  description="CTW Studio is an interaction design engineering practice for AI, data, and knowledge-intensive systems, from first interaction to production."
  ogDescription="Interaction design engineering for AI, data, and knowledge-intensive systems."
  canonical="/"
  current="home"
  bodyClass="studio-home"
  homepageStyles
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="studio-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="ctw-container studio-hero__body">
        <h1 class="ctw-hero__title studio-hero__title" id="hero-title" aria-label="Interaction Design Engineering">
          <span class="studio-title-line" data-canvas-smoke-line aria-hidden="true">Interaction</span>{" "}<br aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="studio-title-line" data-canvas-smoke-line aria-hidden="true">Design</span>{" "}<br aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="studio-title-line studio-hero__accent" data-canvas-smoke-line aria-hidden="true">Engineering</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="ctw-lede studio-hero__lede">
          We design and build applications that help people understand and work with complex AI, data, and workflows, from the <strong>first interaction to production</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="ctw-cluster studio-hero__actions">
          <a class="ctw-button" href="#contact">Get in touch →</a>
          <span class="studio-availability"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Available for collaborations</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="studio-facts" aria-labelledby="studio-facts-title">
        <h2 class="studio-visually-hidden" id="studio-facts-title">Studio facts</h2>
        <div class="ctw-container studio-facts__inner">
          <dl class="studio-facts__stats ctw-coordinate">
            <div><dt class="studio-visually-hidden">Experience</dt><dd><strong>17</strong> years</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="studio-visually-hidden">Projects</dt><dd><strong>50+</strong> projects</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="studio-visually-hidden">Institutions</dt><dd><strong>15</strong> institutions</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="studio-visually-hidden">Location</dt><dd>Amsterdam</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <nav class="studio-facts__links" aria-label="Homepage shortcuts">
            <a class="ctw-link ctw-link--standalone" href="/portfolio/">All projects →</a>
            <a class="ctw-link ctw-link--standalone" href="#about">About →</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="studio-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="ctw-container studio-about">
        <article class="studio-card studio-founder">
          <div class="studio-founder__identity">
            <img class="studio-founder__mark" src="/homepage/jesse-avatar.webp" width="460" height="460" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <div>
              <p class="ctw-heading-md">Jesse Gonzalez</p>
              <p class="ctw-meta">Founder · Interaction Design Engineer</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Interaction Design Engineer with 17+ years in software. Currently working as a Senior Research Software Engineer at the Netherlands eScience Center. Master's in Computer Science and Technology, specializing in Artificial Intelligence.</p>
          <p>Based in Amsterdam, working globally across research, culture, and product development.</p>
          <a class="ctw-link ctw-link--standalone" href="https://jessegonzalez.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Full bio &amp; portfolio ↗</a>
        </article>
        <div class="studio-mission">
          <p class="ctw-section-number">About CTW Studio</p>
          <h2 class="ctw-heading-lg" id="about-title">Creating a<br /><span>Technological World.</span></h2>
          <p class="ctw-lede">CTW Studio is an interaction design engineering practice led by Jesse Gonzalez. We bring together designers, engineers, researchers, and domain specialists when a project needs them.</p>
          <p>We make complex technology tangible through interaction, then engineer it for production.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="studio-section studio-collaborations" id="collaborations" aria-labelledby="collaborations-title">
      <div class="ctw-container studio-split">
        <div class="studio-intro">
          <p class="ctw-section-number">Collaborations</p>
          <h2 class="ctw-heading-lg" id="collaborations-title">Complex systems.<br /><span>Clear interactions.</span></h2>
          <p class="ctw-lede">We work with research teams, cultural organizations, and knowledge-intensive product teams when the technology is complex but the experience cannot be.</p>
          <a class="ctw-button" href="#contact">Start a collaboration →</a>
        </div>
        <ol class="studio-offerings">
          <li class="studio-card"><span>01</span><div><h3 class="ctw-heading-md">Interaction Strategy &amp; Prototyping</h3><p>Frame user needs, system behavior, and technical constraints through collaborative workshops and working prototypes.</p></div></li>
          <li class="studio-card"><span>02</span><div><h3 class="ctw-heading-md">Human–AI Interaction &amp; Systems</h3><p>We design how people understand, direct, inspect, and correct models and agents, with clear boundaries and ways to recover when something goes wrong.</p></div></li>
          <li class="studio-card"><span>03</span><div><h3 class="ctw-heading-md">Data-rich Applications &amp; Visualization</h3><p>Turn complex datasets and workflows into clear, explorable tools for specialists, decision-makers, and public audiences.</p></div></li>
          <li class="studio-card"><span>04</span><div><h3 class="ctw-heading-md">Production Engineering &amp; Product Delivery</h3><p>We build accessible, maintainable applications and integrations, with testing, documentation, and a practical handoff for long-term ownership.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="studio-section" id="how-we-work" aria-labelledby="process-title">
      <div class="ctw-container">
        <p class="ctw-section-number">Our process</p>
        <h2 class="ctw-heading-lg studio-section__title" id="process-title">From first idea to<br /><span>lasting system.</span></h2>
        <div class="studio-process">
          <details class="studio-card">
            <summary><span>01 / Frame</span><strong>Define the right interaction.</strong></summary>
            <p>We align people, decisions, workflows, and constraints before choosing technology. A shared frame gives every design and engineering decision a purpose.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="studio-card">
            <summary><span>02 / Prototype</span><strong>Make complex behavior tangible.</strong></summary>
            <p>Working prototypes turn models, data, and interactions into something teams can test, discuss, and improve early.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="studio-card">
            <summary><span>03 / Engineer</span><strong>Build the production application.</strong></summary>
            <p>We integrate interfaces, models, data, and infrastructure into accessible, maintainable software with visible progress throughout.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="studio-card">
            <summary><span>04 / Sustain</span><strong>Prepare the system to last.</strong></summary>
            <p>Documentation, open standards, testing, and knowledge transfer give your team the confidence to operate and extend what we build.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="studio-section studio-products-section" aria-labelledby="products-title">
      <div class="ctw-container">
        <p class="ctw-section-number">Selected applications</p>
        <h2 class="ctw-heading-lg studio-section__title" id="products-title">Applications in practice.</h2>
        <p class="ctw-lede">Products conceived, designed, and engineered from first interaction to production.</p>
        <div class="studio-products">
          <a class="studio-product studio-product--primary" href="https://notidian.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="/homepage/notidian.avif" width="1200" height="720" alt="Notidian spatial knowledge workspace product interface" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </a>
          <a class="studio-product" href="https://ebookgarden.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="/homepage/ebookgarden.avif" width="1200" height="720" alt="eBookGarden personal ebook library and reader" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </a>
          <a class="studio-product" href="https://www.supertaal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="/homepage/supertaal.avif" width="1200" height="720" alt="SuperTaal multilingual learning application" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </a>
          <a class="studio-product" href="https://ideasdiamond.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="/homepage/ideasdiamond.avif" width="1200" height="720" alt="IdeasDiamond idea development product interface" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </a>
          <a class="studio-product" href="https://nexthuman.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="/homepage/nexthuman.avif" width="1801" height="1081" alt="NextHuman personal capability product artwork" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="studio-section studio-notes" id="methodology">
      <div class="ctw-container">
        <p class="ctw-section-number">What collaborators say</p>
        <h2 class="ctw-heading-lg studio-section__title" id="notes-title">Field notes.</h2>
        <p class="studio-notes__cue" id="field-notes-cue">Scroll field notes →</p>
      </div>
      <div class="studio-quotes" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="notes-title" aria-describedby="field-notes-cue">
        <blockquote class="studio-card"><p>“Jesse has really been <strong>instrumental and decisive</strong> in getting our dashboard off the ground. Right from the start, he grasped the overarching concept and got straight down to business.”</p><footer><cite>Josh Colston, PhD</cite><br />Co-Lead, Mine-DD · University of Virginia</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="studio-card"><p>“The research tool Collens has proven to be a <strong>significant contribution</strong> to our research field. We are thoroughly impressed with Jesse's work and work ethic.”</p><footer><cite>Elli Bleeker, PhD</cite><br />Lead Applicant, COLLaiTE · Huygens Institute (KNAW)</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="studio-card"><p>“This is what we want as the eScience Center. Work that can have <strong>large and long-lasting impact</strong>, beyond the project and beyond the discipline.”</p><footer><cite>Valentina Azzara, PhD</cite><br />Section Head · Netherlands eScience Center</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="studio-card"><p>“His <strong>leadership, initiative, and technical excellence</strong> make him a valuable asset to any team he joins.”</p><footer><cite>Kody Moodley, PhD</cite><br />Senior Researcher · Maastricht University</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="studio-card"><p>“This is <strong>chef's kiss.</strong>”</p><footer><cite>Veronica Pang</cite><br />Communication Advisor · Netherlands eScience Center</footer></blockquote>
      </div>
      <div class="ctw-container studio-partners">
        <p class="ctw-label">Selected partners</p>
        <p>Netherlands eScience Center · KNAW · KNMI · University of Virginia · Maastricht University · Smithsonian Institution</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="studio-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div class="ctw-container ctw-closing studio-contact studio-card">
        <p class="ctw-section-number">Collaborate</p>
        <h2 class="ctw-heading-lg" id="contact-title">Tell us what you're trying to make.</h2>
        <p class="ctw-lede">Bring us a workflow, model, dataset, or product idea that is difficult to explain or use. We'll help you find the interaction at its center and turn it into a working application.</p>
        <div class="ctw-cluster">
          <a class="ctw-button" href="mailto:contact@ctw.studio">contact@ctw.studio</a>
          <a class="ctw-button ctw-button--secondary" href="https://linkedin.com/in/ctwhome" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        </div>
        <p class="ctw-meta">Amsterdam · working globally · accepting projects 2026-2027</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script src="../scripts/home-interactions.ts"></script>
</SiteLayout>
